\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {8}{\ignorespaces The eight cells over the 1{,}200 gradable prompts, one sample per prompt and cell. Accuracy counts a capped generation as a failure, and Capped is the share of generations that reached the token cap. Tokens are input plus output, reasoning included. Latency and energy are means per generation; energy is dynamic board energy, and J per solved divides it by accuracy.}}{13}{}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:cells}{{8}{13}{}{table.8}{}}
\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces The minimum sufficient cell $c^{*}(q)$, in joules, over all prompts and per family. ``None'' marks prompts that no cell answers.}}{13}{}\protected@file@percent }
